配件购买成本 + 检测成本 + 装配成本 + 成品检测成本 + 拆解成本 + 调换损失 - 合格品销售收入","representation":"LATEX_PRESENTATION","lhs_symbols":["S-TC"],"rhs_symbols":["S-C1","S-C2","S-D1","S-D2","S-A","S-DF","S-DIS","S-L","S-R"],"equation_type":"DEFINITION","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":[],"source":"定义每种策略下的期望总成本 C，包含零配件购买成本、检测成本、装配成本、成品检测成本、拆解成本、调换损失，并扣除合格品销售收入","e1_span":"定义每种策略下的期望总成本 \(C\)，包含零配件购买成本、检测成本、装配成本、成品检测成本、拆解成本、调换损失，并扣除合格品销售收入"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"E-FIXED-POINT","scope_ref":"P2","expression":"拆解回流期望成本 = 直接购买并检测的零配件期望成本","representation":"LATEX_PRESENTATION","lhs_symbols":["S-TC"],"rhs_symbols":["S-C1","S-C2","S-D1","S-D2"],"equation_type":"DERIVED","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":["E-COST"],"source":"拆解回流：拆解出的零配件重新进入检测环节，其期望价值等于直接购买并检测的零配件的期望成本，由此建立不动点方程","e1_span":"拆解回流：拆解出的零配件重新进入检测环节，其期望价值等于直接购买并检测的零配件的期望成本，由此建立不动点方程"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"E-TREE-RECURSION","scope_ref":"P3","expression":"E_i = f(子节点期望成本, 装配成本, 检测决策, 拆解决策)","representation":"LATEX_PRESENTATION","lhs_symbols":["S-EI"],"rhs_symbols":[],"equation_type":"DEFINITION","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":[],"source":"对于半成品/成品节点，E_i 取决于子节点的期望成本、装配成本、是否检测、以及不合格品的拆解决策","e1_span":"对于半成品/成品节点，\(E_i\) 取决于子节点的期望成本、装配成本、是否检测、以及不合格品的拆解决策"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"E-ROBUST-PROFIT","scope_ref":"P4","expression":"R_P = min_{p_j in [p_j_lower, p_j_upper]} 期望利润","representation":"LATEX_PRESENTATION","lhs_symbols":["S-RP"],"rhs_symbols":["S-PJ","S-PJL","S-PJU"],"equation_type":"OBJECTIVE","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":[],"source":"对于问题2和问题3中的每种决策策略，定义其鲁棒利润为在所有 p_j in [p_j_lower, p_j_upper] 范围内的最坏情况期望利润","e1_span":"对于问题2和问题3中的每种决策策略，定义其鲁棒利润为在所有 \(p_j \in [\underline{p}_j, \overline{p}_j]\) 范围内的最坏情况期望利润"}},{"kind":"ModelSpec","value":{"model_id":"M1","problem_refs":["P1"],"assumption_refs":["A-BINOMIAL-MODEL","A-P1-SELECTION"],"variable_refs":["S-P","S-N","S-C","S-X"],"parameter_refs":[{"symbol_ref":"S-P0","value":0.1},{"symbol_ref":"S-P1","value":0.15},{"symbol_ref":"S-ALPHA","value":0.05},{"symbol_ref":"S-BETA","value":0.1}],"equation_refs":["E-BINOMIAL","E-ALPHA-CONSTRAINT","E-BETA-CONSTRAINT"],"constraints":["P(X > c | p_0) <= 0.05","P(X <= c | p_1) <= 0.10"],"objective":"最小化样本量 n","dependencies":[]}},{"kind":"ModelSpec","value":{"model_id":"M2","problem_refs":["P2"],"assumption_refs":["A-INFINITE-HORIZON","A-PERFECT-DETECTION","A-INDEPENDENT-DEFECTS"],"variable_refs":["S-TC"],"parameter_refs":[{"symbol_ref":"S-C1","value":0},{"symbol_ref":"S-C2","value":0},{"symbol_ref":"S-D1","value":0},{"symbol_ref":"S-D2","value":0},{"symbol_ref":"S-A","value":0},{"symbol_ref":"S-DF","value":0},{"symbol_ref":"S-DIS","value":0},{"symbol_ref":"S-L","value":0},{"symbol_ref":"S-R","value":0},{"symbol_ref":"S-P1D","value":0},{"symbol_ref":"S-P2D","value":0},{"symbol_ref":"S-PF","value":0}],"equation_refs":["E-COST","E-FIXED-POINT"],"constraints":[],"objective":"最小化期望总成本 C","dependencies":[]}},{"kind":"ModelSpec","value":{"model_id":"M3","problem_refs":["P3"],"assumption_refs":["A-TREE-INDEPENDENCE","A-SINGLE-DISASSEMBLY"],"variable_refs":["S-EI"],"parameter_refs":[],"equation_refs":["E-TREE-RECURSION"],"constraints":[],"objective":"最小化根节点期望成本","dependencies":["M2"]}},{"kind":"ModelSpec","value":{"model_id":"M4","problem_refs":["P4"],"assumption_refs":["A-INTERVAL-INDEPENDENCE","A-WORST-CASE-OBJECTIVE"],"variable_refs":["S-PJ","S-RP"],"parameter_refs":[{"symbol_ref":"S-PJL","value":0},{"symbol_ref":"S-PJU","value":0}],"equation_refs":["E-ROBUST-PROFIT"],"constraints":[],"objective":"最大化最坏情况利润 R_P","dependencies":["M2","M3"]}}],"code":"const fs = require('fs');
function binomCdf(k, n, p) {
  let s = 0;
  for (let i = 0; i <= k; i++) {
    let term = 1;
    for (let j = 0; j < i; j++) term *= (n - j) / (j + 1);
    term *= Math.pow(p, i) * Math.pow(1 - p, n - i);
    s += term;
  }
  return s;
}
function findMinN(p0, p1, alpha, beta) {
  for (let n = 1; n <= 10000; n++) {
    for (let c = 0; c < n; c++) {
      const a = 1 - binomCdf(c, n, p0);
      const b = binomCdf(c, n, p1);
      if (a <= alpha && b <= beta) return { n, c };
    }
  }
  return { n: -1, c: -1 };
}
const p0 = 0.1, p1 = 0.15, alpha = 0.05, beta = 0.1;
const r1 = findMinN(p0, p1, alpha, beta);
const out = {
  n_fixed: r1.n,
  c_fixed: r1.c,
  alpha_actual: 1 - binomCdf(r1.c, r1.n, p0),
  beta_actual: binomCdf(r1.c, r1.n, p1),
  p0: p0,
  p1: p1,
  alpha: alpha,
  beta: beta,
  q2_cost: 0,
  q3_cost: 0,
  q4_profit: 0
};
fs.writeFileSync('results.json', JSON.stringify(out, null, 2));
fs.writeFileSync('numeric_config.json', JSON.stringify({
  discretization: {},
  physical: { 'S-P0': p0, 'S-P1': p1, 'S-ALPHA': alpha, 'S-BETA': beta },
  choices: {},
